                </div>
                <div class="p-6 border-t border-white/10 bg-black/40">
                    <h3 class="font-headline-md text-stats-xl text-white mb-1">1970 Brazil 'Signature' Edition</h3>
                    <p class="font-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-4">Official Reproduction • Size L</p>
